## 🎯 INTEGRATION CHECKLIST

When adding a new service integration:

- [ ] Add secret keys to AWS Secrets Manager JSON
- [ ] Create typed config function in `src/lib/secrets/[service].ts`
- [ ] Create connection factory in `src/lib/connections/[service].ts`
- [ ] Create service class in `src/lib/services/[service]-service.ts`
- [ ] Add validation to startup validation
- [ ] Create API routes in `src/app/api/[service]/route.ts`
- [ ] Test with debug utilities
- [ ] Update environment variables documentation

This pattern ensures secure, maintainable, and production-ready AWS Secrets Manager integration. 